Here is a complete HTML file that builds a pixel-perfect Space Invaders arcade game, recreating the original 1978 Taito cabinet experience.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Space Invaders - 1978 Taito Arcade</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    body {
      background: #000;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    }
    .cabinet-wrapper {
      background: #111;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 20px 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #333, 0 0 20px #0000aa;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .marquee {
      background: #000;
      color: #ff00;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      letter-spacing: 6px;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 8px 0;
      width: 100%;
      border: 2px solid #333;
      border-bottom: 4px solid #ff00;
      text-shadow: 0 0 8px #ff00;
      font-weight: bold;
      background: #000;
    }
